OpenQuota includes pacparser 1.5.1 by Manu Garg.

pacparser is licensed under LGPL-3.0-or-later. Its source files are vendored in
this directory and compiled by src-tauri/build.rs. The corresponding LGPL and
GPL license texts are included as COPYING and GPL-3.0.txt.

OpenQuota modifications (2026-11-28): pacparser.c installs a QuickJS interrupt
handler that ends each script evaluation (pacparser_init, pacparser_parse_pac_string and
pacparser_find_proxy) after a 5-second execution budget, so a PAC script that
never terminates fails instead of blocking its caller. Every other file is
unmodified.

